sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Administrator
    participant CLI as rhaii-validator CLI
    participant Controller as Controller<br/>(kubeconfig auth)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant NodeJob as Agent Job Pod<br/>(privileged SCC)
    participant Host as Worker Node Hardware<br/>(sysfs, GPU, RDMA, NIC)
    participant ConfigMap as Results ConfigMap

    Note over Admin,ConfigMap: Phase 1 - CLI Invocation & Controller Setup

    Admin->>CLI: rhaii-validator [gpu|network|rdma|deps|all]
    CLI->>Controller: Dispatch validation suite
    Controller->>Controller: Load kubeconfig credentials
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Build Kubernetes clientset<br/>(HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+)

    Note over Admin,ConfigMap: Phase 2 - RBAC & Namespace Setup

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Namespace (rhaii-validation)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Namespace created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount (rhaii-validator)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: SA created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ClusterRole (empty)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: ClusterRole created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ClusterRoleBinding
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Binding created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create SCC Binding (privileged)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: SCC Binding created

    Note over Admin,ConfigMap: Phase 3a - Hardware Validation (gpu/rdma/network suites)

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create per-node Agent Jobs
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Jobs created

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over NodeJob,Host: GPU Validation
        NodeJob->>Host: Read /sys/class PCI topology
        Host-->>NodeJob: PCI device info
        NodeJob->>Host: Query GPU driver version, ECC, memory
        Host-->>NodeJob: GPU hardware status
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over NodeJob,Host: RDMA Validation
        NodeJob->>Host: Read /sys/class/infiniband
        Host-->>NodeJob: RDMA device listing
        NodeJob->>Host: ibv_rc_pingpong (connectivity)
        Host-->>NodeJob: RDMA ping result
        NodeJob->>Host: ib_write_bw (bandwidth)
        Host-->>NodeJob: RDMA bandwidth measurement
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over NodeJob,Host: Network Validation
        NodeJob->>NodeJob: Start tcp-lat-server (port 12865)
        NodeJob->>NodeJob: Run tcp-lat-client → server
        NodeJob->>Host: iperf3 bandwidth test
        Host-->>NodeJob: Network performance metrics
    end

    NodeJob-->>K8sAPI: Job completion status

    Note over Admin,ConfigMap: Phase 3b - Dependency Validation (deps suite)

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Query Gateway API CRDs
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: CRD presence/absence
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Query InferencePool CRD
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: CRD presence/absence
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Query LeaderWorkerSet CRD
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: CRD presence/absence
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Query cert-manager CRD
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: CRD presence/absence
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Check operator namespaces<br/>(cert-manager, Istio, LWS)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Namespace presence/absence

    Note over Admin,ConfigMap: Phase 4 - Results Aggregation

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMap<br/>with validation results
    K8sAPI->>ConfigMap: Store results
    Controller-->>CLI: Validation report
    CLI-->>Admin: Display pass/warn/fail results
